BlackthornCity_Text_Rocker_1::
	.string "This is strange...\p"
	.string "They were talking about TEAM\n"
	.string "ROCKET on the radio.$"

BlackthornCity_Text_Rocker_2::
	.string "Arooo!\n"
	.string "Voices in my head!\p"
	.string "Huh? I’m listening to my radio!$"

BlackthornCity_Text_Woman2::
	.string "Wow, you came through the ICE\n"
	.string "PATH?\p"
	.string "You must be a real hotshot trainer!$"

BlackthornCity_Text_Lass::
	.string "Are you going to make your POKéMON\n"
	.string "forget some moves?$"

BlackthornCity_Text_OldMan1::
	.string "Only dragon users are permitted to\n"
	.string "train here.\l"
	.string "Please leave.$"

BlackthornCity_Text_Man_1::
	.string "Our GYM LEADER is waiting for you.\p"
	.string "However, it would be impossible for\n"
	.string "a run-of-the-mill trainer to win.$"

BlackthornCity_Text_Man_2::
	.string "You defeated our GYM LEADER?\n"
	.string "That’s amazing!\p"
	.string "With your power, you should succeed\n"
	.string "in the POKéMON LEAGUE.$"

BlackthornCity_Text_Youngster::
	.string "I’m going to be a dragon user like\n"
	.string "CLAIR.$"

BlackthornCity_Text_Man2::
	.string "I am sorry.\p"
	.string "Our GYM LEADER is training in the\n"
	.string "cave behind here.\p"
	.string "I have no idea when our LEADER\n"
	.string "will return.$"

BlackthornCity_Text_Trigger3::
	.string "PROF.ELM: Hello, {PLAYER}?\p"
	.string "I have something here for you.\p"
	.string "Could you swing by my LAB?\p"
	.string "See you later!\p"
	.string "END OF MESSAGE.$"

BlackthornCity_Text_Sign1::
	.string "BLACKTHORN CITY\n"
	.string "A Quiet Mountain Retreat$"

BlackthornCity_Text_Sign2::
	.string "MOVE DELETER’S HOUSE$"

BlackthornCity_Text_Sign3::
	.string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
	.string "A POKéMON holding a LUM BERRY will\n"
	.string "cure itself of any status problem.$"

BlackthornCity_Text_Sign4::
	.string "BLACKTHORN CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: CLAIR\l"
	.string "The Blessed User of Dragon POKéMON$"

BlackthornCity_Text_Sign5::
	.string "DRAGON’S DEN AHEAD$"

